title: Locked Cabinet
story: fever-dream
description: Tests the locked cabinet puzzle in Cold Storage

---

$teleport Cold Storage

## Cabinet starts locked and closed

> open cabinet
[OK: contains "locked"]
[EVENT: false, type="if.event.opened"]

## Cannot unlock without key

> unlock cabinet
[OK: not contains "unlocked"]

## Unlock with brass key

$take brass key

> unlock cabinet with brass key
[OK: contains "unlock"]
[EVENT: true, type="if.event.unlocked"]

## Open reveals contents

> open cabinet
[OK: contains "open"]
[EVENT: true, type="if.event.opened"]

> look in cabinet
[OK: contains "fungus"]
